{"step_index":169,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T10:47:12Z","content":"The frontend for **NEXUS**, the AI-powered criminal network analysis dashboard, has been built, tested, and is currently running live.\n\n### Project Workspace\nThe project is located at:\n`C:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\nexus`\n\n---\n\n### Key Highlights & Features\n\n1. **Law-Enforcement Intelligence Aesthetic**:\n   - High-density data displays, security classification headers (`TOP SECRET // SI // NOFORN`), tactical monospace coordinates, DEFCON indicators, and custom telemetry color accents.\n   - Dual theme support: Tactical Night Mode (default) and Analytical Day Mode with one-click toggling from the top navigation and settings.\n   - Purposeful, subtle micro-interactions with zero distracting animations.\n\n2. **All 8 Pages Implemented**:\n   - [**Login** (`/login`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx): Officer badge authentication (`FED-8491`), division selection, hardware token verification, and quick-login evaluation buttons.\n   - [**Dashboard** (`/`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx): Mission command center with 4 tactical KPI cards, live interactive syndicate topology radar, real-time intercept alert stream, and active cases table.\n   - [**Cases** (`/cases`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/CasesPage.tsx): Multi-jurisdiction case dossiers, warrant tracking, asset seizure tallies ($123.5M), search/priority filters, and a charter creation modal.\n   - [**Upload Evidence** (`/upload`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/UploadEvidencePage.tsx): Ingestion vault with automatic SHA-256 hash generation, chain of custody logging, 4-stage AI pipeline visualizer, and evidence card archive.\n   - [**Network Analysis** (`/network`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/NetworkAnalysisPage.tsx): Full-screen interactive graph workbench with canvas pan, zoom, node selection, degree/betweenness inspection, shortest-path attribution pathfinder, risk slider filters, and export options.\n   - [**Entity Profile** (`/entity/:id`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/EntityProfilePage.tsx): Deep-dive suspect and corporation dossiers with HVT threat gauges (96/100), GPS fixes, and tabs for *Overview*, *Network Associates*, *Financial Footprint*, *Intercepted Comms*, *Evidence Binder*, and *AI Flight Risk Synthesis*.\n   - [**Investigation Timeline** (`/timeline`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/TimelinePage.tsx): Chronological event stream correlating wiretaps, financial wires, ANPR sightings, and raids, filterable by target and category.\n   - [**Settings** (`/settings`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx): AI anomaly and biometric confidence threshold sliders, theme switches, FIDO2 token status, and immutable CJIS audit logs.\n\n3. **All Required Reusable Components**:\n   - [Sidebar](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx)\n   - [TopNav](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/layout/TopNav.tsx)\n   - [MetricCard](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/MetricCard.tsx)\n   - [DataTable](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/DataTable.tsx)\n   - [NetworkGraphContainer](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/network/NetworkGraphContainer.tsx)\n   - [EvidenceCard](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components