adav, Priya Singh, Suresh Sharma, Neha Gupta, Scorpio `UP14 AB 1234`, Hawala Bank Account).\n   - Graph labels will be prominent and uncluttered so hackathon judges can immediately understand the criminal connections in a 3-minute pitch.\n4. **[`MetricCard.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/MetricCard.tsx)**:\n   - Updated to feature the exact 4 hackathon metrics requested: **12 Persons**, **8 Locations**, **15 Relationships**, and **3 Possible Patterns**.\n5. **[`EvidenceCard.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/EvidenceCard.tsx)** & **[`EntityCard.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/EntityCard.tsx)**:\n   - Simplified to display Indian vehicle numbers, masked phone numbers, Indian locations, and rupee values (`₹`).\n\n---\n\n### 3. Which files will be changed or created?\n- **[`src/types/index.ts`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/types/index.ts)**: Adapted for Indian sample patterns and currency.\n- **[`src/data/mockData.ts`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/data/mockData.ts)**: Replaced with 12 Indian persons, 8 Indian locations, 15 relationships, 3 crime patterns, vehicle numbers (`UP14 AB 1234`), masked phones (`98XXXXXX21`), and INR (`₹`).\n- **[`src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx)**: Reorganized around the 4 simplified metrics (12 Persons, 8 Locations, 15 Relationships, 3 Patterns) and a dedicated \"Detected Crime Patterns\" card.\n- **[`src/pages/UploadEvidencePage.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/UploadEvidencePage.tsx)**: Adapted for Indian evidence ingestion (CDR Excel, UPI/Bank statements in ₹, FASTag / ANPR toll camera logs).\n- **[`src/pages/NetworkAnalysisPage.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/NetworkAnalysisPage.tsx)**: Streamlined graph workbench showing the simplified 5–8 connected core network.\n- **[`src/pages/EntityProfilePage.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/EntityProfilePage.tsx)**: Rebranded as **Person Details** with Indian suspect dossiers, vehicles, and ₹ financial flows.\n- **`src/pages/EvidenceDetailsPage.tsx` [NEW]**: Clean screen to inspect evidence records, chain of custody under Indian police jurisdiction, and extracted entities.\n- **[`src/App.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/App.tsx)**: Cleaned up routes for the 5 main screens (`/`, `/upload`, `/network`, `/person/:id`, `/evidence/:id`).\n\n---\n\nYou can review the full implementation plan in [implementation_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fb69bf55-26d8-4420-a8a5-e461b2943c07/implementation_plan.md). \n\nPlease let me know if you would like me to proceed with these changes!"}
