{"step_index":225,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T19:39:02Z","thinking":"**Implementing Approved Changes**\n\nBegin the implementation by modifying the type definitions to accommodate the new crime pattern and Indian context. Next, the mock data requires updating with the addition of the 12 new persons, including their roles, risk assessment, and locations.\n\n\n**Incorporating New Information**\n\nThe provided data expands the scope to include specific individuals, their roles, risk levels, and locations across multiple Indian cities. There are strong relationships and potential crime patterns, including hawala money routing, FASTag coordinated transit, and burner SIM relay. The Indian vehicle numbers and masked phone numbers necessitate updating the crime pattern analysis.\n\n\n**Refining Interface and Data**\n\nThe interface requires adaptation for the Indian context, including specific evidence types like CDR logs and UPI statements. The network graph needs simplification to showcase key entities with readable labels and clear relationships. I will use the new data to populate the dashboard metrics and present the crime patterns.\n\nI need to focus on branding the application for the Delhi Police and updating the evidence upload page with Indian evidence presets. \"Person Details\" should replace \"Entity Profile\" for suspect information, including masked phone numbers.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"export type EntityType = \n  | 'suspect' \n  | 'organization' \n  | 'shell_company' \n  | 'vehicle' \n  | 'burner_phone' \n  | 'bank_account' \n  | 'safehouse'\n\nexport type RiskLevel = 'CRITICAL' | 'HIGH' | 'ELEVATED' | 'LOW'\n\nexport interface Entity {\n  id: string\n  name: string\n  type: EntityType\n  riskScore: number // 0-100\n  riskLevel: RiskLevel\n  status: 'Active Warrant' | 'Under Surveillance' | 'Detained' | 'Fugitive' | 'Flagged Entity' | 'Monitored'\n  aliases: string[]\n  primaryAffiliation: string\n  role: string\n  phoneMasked?: string\n  vehicleNumber?: string\n  city: string\n  nationality?: string\n  photo?: string\n  lastKnownLocation: {\n    name: string\n    city: string\n    lat: number\n    lng: number\n    timestamp: string\n  }\n  tags: string[]\n  details: {\n    dob?: string\n    pob?: string\n    wantedFor?: string[]\n    knownAssociatesCount: number\n    totalFinancialFlow: string // in ₹\n    wiretapsCount: number\n  }\n}\n\nexport interface CrimePattern {\n  id: string\n  title: string\n  category: 'Hawala Loop' | 'FASTag Transit' | 'SIM Call Burst'\n  description: string\n  confidence: number\n  involvedEntities: string[]\n  locations: string[]\n  keyMetric: string\n  severity: 'CRITICAL' | 'HIGH' | 'ELEVATED'\n}\n\nexport type CaseStatus = \n  | 'Active Investigation' \n  | 'Chargesheet Filed' \n  | 'Surveillance Phase' \n  | 'Interdiction Imminent' \n  | 'Closed'\n\nexport type PriorityLevel = 'CRITICAL' | 'HIGH' | 'MEDIUM'\n\nexport interface Case {\n  id: string\n  caseNumber: string\n  title: string\n  description: string\n  codeName: string\n  status: CaseStatus\n  priority: PriorityLevel\n  leadInvestigator: string\n  agency: string\n  jurisdiction: string\n  openedDate: string\n  lastUpdated: string\n  warrantsIssued: number\n  assetsSeized: string\n  entitiesCount: number\n  evidenceCount: number\n  riskIndex: number\n}\n\nexport type EvidenceType = \n  | 'cdr' \n  | 'financial' \n  | 'wiretap' \n  | 'surveillance' \n  | 'forensics' \n  | 'document'\n\nexport type ClassificationLevel = \n  | 'CONFIDENTIAL' \n  | 'LAW ENFORCEMENT SENSITIVE' \n  | 'RESTRICTED POLICE RECORD'\n\nexport interface Evidence {\n  id: string\n  evidenceNumber: string\n  caseId: string\n  caseName: string\n  title: string\n  type: EvidenceType\n  classification: ClassificationLevel\n  dateCollected: string\n  collectedBy: string\n  badgeNumber: string\n  location: string\n  city: string\n  hashSHA256: string\n  aiSummar